    "lastCommit": {
      "id": "dc37a4ddc577b179f1670795ec3b76c632ec78a5",
      "message": "OTA-1890 \u2014 the studio card, and the source it came from (GOLEM ONLY, source)\n\nIteration 8 release identity: stamps OTA_BUILD_ID 2026-10-04-1890 and adds the ota1890 suite the\nstamp gate requires. The content is the already-validated candidate 4ba03978: Hot Attic Games studio\nsplash on the canonical artwork, the painted-before-reload applying overlay, About public version and\nCopy All source SHA, the road-door hunt reach rule (I-055), the Climbing Strap for every race (I-054),\nand the heal-batch no-op guard (I-010). OTA-capable, no native change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LGFtzR6AQJbu4XdR28y3fX",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-04T23:39:42Z",
      "pullRequest": {
        "id": "31",
        "title": "Iteration 8 candidate: QA batch + PR #29 + #30 on one SHA (HELD \u2014 merging publishes an OTA)",
        "message": "## One integration SHA: `4ba0397805d3b1fcf709367157f652b043bb5375`\n\ngolem-line (`b259542a`) + the whole candidate. **Merging publishes an OTA to Golem, so it is held for the owner.** CI on this exact SHA: all 8 required jobs and the heavy-sims job green (run 37229050813).\n\n**Contents**\n- Overlay \"Please wait, applying update\" (render-before-reload), About identity + Copy All, source SHA in `extra`, studio splash on `Hot_Attic_Games_Master_Logo_ALPHA_FINAL.png` (PRs #29, #30).\n- QA batch: heal-batch true-no-op guard (I-010), qualification-evidence fixes (I-017/18/52), road-door hunt reach rule (I-055), and the Hardened Climbing Strap for every race (I-054 \u2014 **owner decision pending; this commit can be dropped alone**).\n- `build-apk.yml`: no branch builds an APK merely on push (it publishes a Release).\n- Tests: walker follows the Arbiter's \"take it outside\"; two fixtures stop leaning on a fresh character's HP; `interactionStress` stops claiming rotation; new `ambientRotationIsReal` (red 3/6 under a rotation-off mutation).\n\n**Not verified:** nothing here has been checked on a device.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LGFtzR6AQJbu4XdR28y3fX\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01LGFtzR6AQJbu4XdR28y3fX)_",
